ts were used to generate the libraries, according to manufacturer's instructions (Illumina). rRNAs removed, random fragmentation, stranded library</LIBRARY_CONSTRUCTION_PROTOCOL></LIBRARY_DESCRIPTOR></DESIGN><PLATFORM><ILLUMINA><INSTRUMENT_MODEL>Illumina HiSeq 1500</INSTRUMENT_MODEL></ILLUMINA></PLATFORM><EXPERIMENT_LINKS><EXPERIMENT_LINK><XREF_LINK><DB>gds</DB><ID>303176785</ID><LABEL>GSM3176785</LABEL></XREF_LINK></EXPERIMENT_LINK></EXPERIMENT_LINKS><EXPERIMENT_ATTRIBUTES><EXPERIMENT_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>GEO Accession</TAG><VALUE>GSM3176785</VALUE></EXPERIMENT_ATTRIBUTE></EXPERIMENT_ATTRIBUTES></EXPERIMENT><SUBMISSION alias="GEO: GSE115371" broker_name="GEO" center_name="GEO" submission_comment="submission brokered by GEO" lab_name="" accession="SRA715445"><IDENTIFIERS><PRIMARY_ID>SRA715445</PRIMARY_ID><SUBMITTER_ID namespace="GEO">GEO: GSE115371</SUBMITTER_ID></IDENTIFIERS></SUBMISSION><Organization type="center"><Name abbr="GEO">NCBI</Name><Contact email="geo-group@ncbi.nlm.nih.gov"><Name><First>Geo</First><Last>Curators</Last></Name></Contact></Organization><STUDY center_name="GEO" alias="GSE115371" accession="SRP149823"><IDENTIFIERS><PRIMARY_ID>SRP149823</PRIMARY_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="BioProject" label="primary">PRJNA474721</EXTERNAL_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="GEO">GSE115371</EXTERNAL_ID></IDENTIFIERS><DESCRIPTOR><STUDY_TITLE>RNA-seq and DNA methylomes of germinating rice and developing coleoptiles (RNA-Seq)</STUDY_TITLE><STUDY_TYPE existing_study_type="Transcriptome Analysis"/><STUDY_ABSTRACT>RNAseq profiling of seeds and 7 time points during germination in rice under aerobic and anerobic conditions, as well as following re-oxygenation. Overall design: Total RNA was extracted from samples collected at each time point in triplicate. The time points were: 0 h (dry seed), 1 h, 3 h, 12 h, 24 h, 2 days, 3 days and 4 days under aerobic (A) and anaerobic (N) conditions, as well as 3-day-old seedlings grown under anaerobic conditions that were switched to air for 1 day.</STUDY_ABSTRACT><CENTER_PROJECT_NAME>GSE115371</CENTER_PROJECT_NAME></DESCRIPTOR><STUDY_LINKS><STUDY_LINK><XREF_LINK><DB>pubmed</DB><ID>27859855</ID></XREF_LINK></STUDY_LINK></STUDY_LINKS><STUDY_ATTRIBUTES><STUDY_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>parent_bioproject</TAG><VALUE>PRJNA474719</VALUE></STUDY_ATTRIBUTE></STUDY_ATTRIBUTES></STUDY><SAMPLE alias="GSM3176785" accession="SRS3381437"><IDENTIFIERS><PRIMARY_ID>SRS3381437</PRIMARY_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="BioSample">SAMN09371414</EXTERNAL_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="GEO">GSM3176785</EXTERNAL_ID></IDENTIFIERS><TITLE>seeds following 24 h of anaerobic germination (24hN) Replicate 1</TITLE><SAMPLE_NAME><TAXON_ID>4530</TAXON_ID><SCIENTIFIC_NAME>Oryza sativa</SCIENTIFIC_NAME></SAMPLE_NAME><SAMPLE_LINKS><SAMPLE_LINK><XREF_LINK><DB>bioproject</DB><ID>474721</ID><LABEL>PRJNA474721</LABEL></XREF_LINK></SAMPLE_LINK></SAMPLE_LINKS><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTES><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>source_name</TAG><VALUE>Rice germinating embryos</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>tissue</TAG><VALUE>germinating embryos</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>genotype</TAG><VALUE>WT(Oryza sativa cv Amaroo)</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>age</TAG><VALUE>seeds following 24 h of anaerobic germination (24hN) Replicate 1</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>treatment/conditions</TAG><VALUE>De-hulled sterilised seeds were grown in MES culture medium bubbled with nitrogen gas (anaerobic-N) at 30 C in the dark for 24 h.</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTES></SAMPLE><Pool><Member member_name="" accession="SRS3381437" sample_name="GSM3176785" sample_title="seeds following 24 h of anaerobic germination (24hN) Replicate 1" spots="22068958" bases="2118619968" tax_id="4530" organism="Oryza sativa"><IDENTIFIERS><PRIMARY_ID>SRS3381437</PRIMARY_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="BioSample">SAMN09371414</EXTERNAL_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="GEO">GSM3176785</EXTERNAL_ID></IDENTIFIERS></Member></Pool><RUN_SET runs="1" bases="2118619968"