veloping coleoptiles (RNA-Seq)</STUDY_TITLE><STUDY_TYPE existing_study_type="Transcriptome Analysis"/><STUDY_ABSTRACT>RNAseq profiling of seeds and 7 time points during germination in rice under aerobic and anerobic conditions, as well as following re-oxygenation. Overall design: Total RNA was extracted from samples collected at each time point in triplicate. The time points were: 0 h (dry seed), 1 h, 3 h, 12 h, 24 h, 2 days, 3 days and 4 days under aerobic (A) and anaerobic (N) conditions, as well as 3-day-old seedlings grown under anaerobic conditions that were switched to air for 1 day.</STUDY_ABSTRACT><CENTER_PROJECT_NAME>GSE115371</CENTER_PROJECT_NAME></DESCRIPTOR><STUDY_LINKS><STUDY_LINK><XREF_LINK><DB>pubmed</DB><ID>27859855</ID></XREF_LINK></STUDY_LINK></STUDY_LINKS><STUDY_ATTRIBUTES><STUDY_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>parent_bioproject</TAG><VALUE>PRJNA474719</VALUE></STUDY_ATTRIBUTE></STUDY_ATTRIBUTES></STUDY><SAMPLE alias="GSM3176765" accession="SRS3381416"><IDENTIFIERS><PRIMARY_ID>SRS3381416</PRIMARY_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="BioSample">SAMN09371434</EXTERNAL_ID><EXTERNAL_ID namespace="GEO">GSM3176765</EXTERNAL_ID></IDENTIFIERS><TITLE>seeds following 1 h of aerobic germination (1hA) Replicate 2</TITLE><SAMPLE_NAME><TAXON_ID>4530</TAXON_ID><SCIENTIFIC_NAME>Oryza sativa</SCIENTIFIC_NAME></SAMPLE_NAME><SAMPLE_LINKS><SAMPLE_LINK><XREF_LINK><DB>bioproject</DB><ID>474721</ID><LABEL>PRJNA474721</LABEL></XREF_LINK></SAMPLE_LINK></SAMPLE_LINKS><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTES><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>source_name</TAG><VALUE>Rice germinating embryos</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>tissue</TAG><VALUE>germinating embryos</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>genotype</TAG><VALUE>WT(Oryza sativa cv Amaroo)</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>age</TAG><VALUE>seeds following 1 h of aerobic germination (1hA) Replicate 2</VALUE></SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><SAMPLE_ATTRIBUTE><TAG>treatment/conditions</TAG><VALUE>De-hulled sterilised seeds were grown in MES culture mediu